{
    "title": "Phase 10: World Tour",
    "description": "Start playing Phase 10 for FREE TODAY - The fun and classic mobile card game enjoyed by millions of players around the world.\r\n\r\nPhase 10 in the newest rummy inspired card game brought to you from the creators of UNO! bringing friends and families together for over 40 years. Play all your favorite classics ONLINE TODAY such as Uno, Phase 10, Solitaire, Skip-Bo, and more. There's nothing more convenient and perfect for any card or party game lovers!\r\n\r\nTake 10 minutes for yourself and enjoy a quick round of Phase 10 anytime! It's always a good time to play Phase 10!\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY PHASE 10?\r\nRace to complete each \u201cPhase\u201d and stay ahead. Every Phase has its own sets of cards to match their colors and numbers. When you have your sets, throw them down for everyone to see. The round ends when one player frees their hand of all their cards. Everyone who completes the Phase moves on to the next challenge. Players who can\u2019t finish the Phase start over and try again.\r\n\r\nDAILY CHALLENGES\r\nTrain your brain daily with new puzzles on every level. Watch carefully for patterns and outwit the game. Unlock new rules to explore and solve and become a Phase 10 master!\r\n\r\nPLAY OFFLINE\r\nTake your dream vacation and travel around the world in Journey mode! Play offline and relax in zen-like solitaire challenges. Use Power-Ups to get an edge and win rewards! Phase 10 is a blast!\r\n\r\nCOMPETE WITH THE COMMUNITY\r\nCompete with others online to win coins and be part of the international community. Skip the airport and explore faraway places! Phase 10 tours from the comfort of a Pacific paradise to the chilling extremes of the ice capped mountains! See if you can stand atop the world!\r\n\r\nMONTHLY EVENTS\r\nKeep things fresh by playing in a new themed event every month! Roll the dice, collect new materials, send gifts to friends, and more! There's always a new way to play. Phase 10 has fun in spades! There's always something new to explore!\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this addictive rummy card game! DOWNLOAD NOW and start an exciting card adventure for endless fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Start playing Phase 10 for FREE TODAY - The fun and classic mobile card game enjoyed by millions of players around the world.<br><br>Phase 10 in the newest rummy inspired card game brought to you from the creators of UNO! bringing friends and families together for over 40 years. Play all your favorite classics ONLINE TODAY such as Uno, Phase 10, Solitaire, Skip-Bo, and more. There&#39;s nothing more convenient and perfect for any card or party game lovers!<br><br>Take 10 minutes for yourself and enjoy a quick round of Phase 10 anytime! It&#39;s always a good time to play Phase 10!<br><br><br>HOW TO PLAY PHASE 10?<br>Race to complete each \u201cPhase\u201d and stay ahead. Every Phase has its own sets of cards to match their colors and numbers. When you have your sets, throw them down for everyone to see. The round ends when one player frees their hand of all their cards. Everyone who completes the Phase moves on to the next challenge. Players who can\u2019t finish the Phase start over and try again.<br><br>DAILY CHALLENGES<br>Train your brain daily with new puzzles on every level. Watch carefully for patterns and outwit the game. Unlock new rules to explore and solve and become a Phase 10 master!<br><br>PLAY OFFLINE<br>Take your dream vacation and travel around the world in Journey mode! Play offline and relax in zen-like solitaire challenges. Use Power-Ups to get an edge and win rewards! Phase 10 is a blast!<br><br>COMPETE WITH THE COMMUNITY<br>Compete with others online to win coins and be part of the international community. Skip the airport and explore faraway places! Phase 10 tours from the comfort of a Pacific paradise to the chilling extremes of the ice capped mountains! See if you can stand atop the world!<br><br>MONTHLY EVENTS<br>Keep things fresh by playing in a new themed event every month! Roll the dice, collect new materials, send gifts to friends, and more! There&#39;s always a new way to play. Phase 10 has fun in spades! There&#39;s always something new to explore!<br><br>Don&#39;t miss out on this addictive rummy card game! DOWNLOAD NOW and start an exciting card adventure for endless fun!",
